  "description": {
   "en": "\"I'll see you again tomorrow...\"\n\nUchihama Academy is at its most exciting during its last cultural festival in the old school building, which has been decided to close. Kanade Akiyama, a member of the astronomical society, works hard to maintain public order within the school, and one day he meets Yui Furukawa, a beautiful girl with amnesia.",
   "ja": "内浜学園は廃校が決まった旧校舎での最後の文化祭に最高の盛り上がりを見せていた。「校内の治安維持」のため奔走する、天文学会の秋山奏は、ある時、記憶喪失の美少女・古川ゆいと出会う。"
  },
